   "source": [
    "# Swimming Pool Lane Line Detection — YOLO26n-seg\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook fine-tunes a YOLO26n-seg segmentation model to detect swimming\n",
    "pool lane lines and T-marks from images, as a step toward the spatial-awareness\n",
    "component of the blind swimming assistive device project.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Approach:** transfer learning on Ultralytics' YOLO26n-seg (nano segmentation\n",
    "model), fine-tuned on a labeled pool-lane dataset.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset:** labeled via Roboflow — *[link to be added]*. Two classes:\n",
    "`lane` (lane line markings) and `t_mark` (the T-shaped wall/turn markers).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Pipeline:** Setup -> Data -> Train -> Predict (CLI sanity check) -> Inference &\n",
    "visualization (custom labeled overlay) -> Results on multiple test images.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "29326cce",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Configuration\n",
    "\n",
    "Central place for paths and hyperparameters used below."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "492857b5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "DATASET_CONFIG = \"data.yaml\"       # Roboflow-exported dataset config\n",
    "MODEL_NAME = \"yolo26n-seg.pt\"      # pretrained checkpoint to fine-tune from\n",
    "IMAGE_SIZE = 640\n",
    "EPOCHS = 100\n",
    "BATCH_SIZE = 16\n",
    "DEVICE = 0                          # GPU index; set to \"cpu\" if no GPU\n",
    "PROJECT_NAME = \"lane-line-detection\"\n",
    "RUN_NAME = \"baseline\"\n",
    "SEED = 42\n",
    "\n",
    "# Path to the best checkpoint produced by training (used throughout inference below)\n",
    "BEST_WEIGHTS = \"/content/runs/segment/train/weights/best.pt\"\n",
    "\n",
    "# Test images used to sanity-check the trained model\n",
    "TEST_IMAGES = [\n",
    "    \"/content/povswim1.jpg\",\n",
    "    \"/content/poolmanylines.jpg\",\n",
    "    \"/content/povswim2.jpg\",\n",
    "]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "35f731fd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<a href=\"https://colab.research.google.com/github/kornranath/PoolDetection/blob/main/pool_yolo.ipynb\" target=\"_parent\"><img src=\"https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg\" alt=\"Open In Colab\"/></a>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "67cffcae",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
